<BaseLayout title={'About: the engineers who build the networks’ tooling and do the integrations | The Aha Company'} description={'The Aha Company: twelve-plus engineers across the United States, Europe and Brazil, founded 2021. How we work, who we are, and the ecosystems we hold roles in.'}>
<main><section><div class="ab_introcontainer"><a class="art_back" data-back="1" href="/">← Back to home</a><div class="ab_introhead"><p class="cs_eyebrow">About</p><h1 class="intro_h1">We build the tooling. We do the integrations.</h1><p class="art_lede" data-rv="about-lede">Founded in 2021. Twelve-plus engineers across the United States, Europe and Brazil. Core contributors on Stellar, program partners on XRPL, integrations in progress on Canton.</p></div><figure class="ab_photo"><img alt="The Aha Company team around a table in the office" class="ab_photoimg" loading="lazy" src="/images/photos/team-photo-office.webp"/><figcaption class="ab_photocaption">The team · United States · France · Brazil</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class="ab_facts"><div class="ab_factscontainer"><ul class="ab_factsgrid" role="list"><li class="ab_fact" data-rv="fact-founded"><span class="ab_factnum">2021</span><span class="ab_factlabel">Founded</span></li><li class="ab_fact" data-rv="fact-team"><span class="ab_factnum">12+</span><span class="ab_factlabel">Engineers</span></li><li class="ab_fact"><span class="ab_factnum">3</span><span class="ab_factlabel">Countries: United States, France, Brazil</span></li></ul></div></section><section class="ab_white"><div class="ab_container"><div class="ab_howgrid"><div class="ab_howhead"><h2 class="ab_h2">How we work</h2><p class="art_lede">One voice for two very different rooms: a bank’s risk committee and a protocol team’s GitHub.</p></div><ul class="ab_howlist" role="list"><li class="ab_howrow"><h3 class="ab_howtitle">An engineer on every call</h3><p class="ab_howbody">The first conversation is thirty minutes with someone who has shipped the kind of system you are asking about. No sales team.</p></li><li class="ab_howrow"><h3 class="ab_howtitle">Milestones your team can verify</h3><p class="ab_howbody">NDA, then an MOU with the scope cut into milestones. Each one has an output you can check, on testnet, before mainnet.</p></li><li class="ab_howrow"><h3 class="ab_howtitle">We say no early</h3><p class="ab_howbody">Where an ecosystem program applies, we scope and draft the application. Where it doesn’t, or where the architecture is wrong for the network, we say so before any work starts.</p></li><li class="ab_howrow"><h3 class="ab_howtitle">We stay on the account</h3><p class="ab_howbody">Production surfaces questions a testnet never asks. Deployment comes with runbooks and handover, and we keep evolving the system with your team after launch.</p></li><li class="ab_howrow"><h3 class="ab_howtitle">Public goods, maintained</h3><p class="ab_howbody">The tooling we build for ecosystems is open source with a quarterly proposal and review, not a one-off deliverable.</p></li></ul></div></div></section><section class="ab_team" data-ab="team"><div class="ab_container"><div class="tm_teamhead"><h2 class="ab_h2">The team</h2><p class="tm_count">The core team · United States · France · Brazil · Austria</p></div><TeamGrid variant="about" /></div></section><section class="ab_white"><div class="ab_container"><h2 class="ab_h2">Roles we hold in the ecosystems</h2><ul class="ab_rolesgrid" role="list"><li class="ab_rolecard"><img alt="Stellar" class="ab_rolelogo" loading="lazy" src="/images/logos/logo-light-stellar.webp"/><p class="ab_rolebody"><span data-rv="about-roles">Core contributor · Stellar Community Fund reviewer · Stellar Architect Program expert · maintainer of Scaffold Stellar, the Stellar CLI plugin system, Stellar Registry, Nido, Perch, Moonlight and Tansu</span></p></li><li class="ab_rolecard"><img alt="XRPL" class="ab_rolelogo" loading="lazy" src="/images/logos/logo-xrpl-transparent.webp"/><p class="ab_rolebody">Ripple program partner: accelerator cohorts and hackathons, continuous work on developer experience</p></li><li class="ab_rolecard"><img alt="Canton" class="ab_rolelogo" loading="lazy" src="/images/logos/logo-light-canton.webp"/><p class="ab_rolebody">Integrations in progress</p></li></ul><a class="svc_casecta os_aboutlink" data-rv="about-os" href="/open-source">See the tools we build and maintain →</a></div></section><section class="footer_section"><div class="ab_officescontainer"><div class="ab_officesgrid"><div class="ab_office"><h3 class="ab_officecountry">United States</h3><p class="ab_officeentity" data-rv="office-us">Dawning Inc. (dba The Aha Company)</p><p class="ab_officeaddr" data-rv="office-us-desc">Our US entity. It employs our US-based engineers and contracts with clients and partners in the United States.</p><p class="ab_officeaddr"><span>108 W. 13th Street, Suite 100</span><br/><span>Wilmington, DE 19801</span></p></div><div class="ab_office"><h3 class="ab_officecountry">France</h3><p class="ab_officeentity" data-rv="office-fr">Limus Vita SAS (dba The Aha Company)</p><p class="ab_officeaddr" data-rv="office-fr-desc">Our European entity, in Paris. It contracts with clients and programs in Europe.</p><p class="ab_officeaddr"><span>9 rue des Colonnes</span><br/><span>75002 Paris</span></p></div><div class="ab_office"><h3 class="ab_officecountry">Brazil</h3><p class="ab_officeentity" data-rv="office-br">The Aha Company LTDA</p><p class="ab_officeaddr" data-rv="office-br-desc">Our Latin American entity, led by Fabricius Zatti. It takes on projects across Brazil and Latin America.</p><p class="ab_officeaddr"><span>São Paulo, Brazil</span></p></div></div></div></section></main>
